        "fr": "Voici un pipeline GitLab CI. Trouvez les **quatre** problèmes de sécurité et réécrivez-le.\n\n```yaml\ndeploy:\n  image: alpine:latest\n  script:\n    - echo \"Token is $DEPLOY_TOKEN\"\n    - apk add --no-cache curl\n    - 'curl -k -H \"Authorization: Bearer $DEPLOY_TOKEN\" https://deploy.example.com/release'\n  variables:\n    DB_PASSWORD: \"Pr0d-P@ssw0rd\"\n```\n\nIndice : regardez l'image, ce qui est affiché dans les journaux, les options de `curl`, les\nvariables, et **quand** le job s'exécute.\n",
        "en": "Here is a GitLab CI pipeline. Find the **four** security problems and rewrite it.\n\n```yaml\ndeploy:\n  image: alpine:latest\n  script:\n    - echo \"Token is $DEPLOY_TOKEN\"\n    - apk add --no-cache curl\n    - 'curl -k -H \"Authorization: Bearer $DEPLOY_TOKEN\" https://deploy.example.com/release'\n  variables:\n    DB_PASSWORD: \"Pr0d-P@ssw0rd\"\n```\n\nHint: look at the image, what is printed in the logs, the `curl` options, the variables, and\n**when** the job runs.\n"
