        "kind": "secure",
        "code": "apiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: api\n  namespace: shop\nspec:\n  replicas: 2\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: api\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: api\n    spec:\n      serviceAccountName: api\n      automountServiceAccountToken: false # the app does not call the Kubernetes API\n      securityContext:\n        runAsNonRoot: true\n        runAsUser: 10001\n        seccompProfile:\n          type: RuntimeDefault\n      containers:\n        - name: api\n          # Immutable reference: tag for humans, digest for the cluster (example digest)\n          image: registry.example.com/api:1.4.2@sha256:0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\n          ports:\n            - containerPort: 8000\n          securityContext:\n            allowPrivilegeEscalation: false\n            readOnlyRootFilesystem: true\n            capabilities:\n              drop: [\"ALL\"]\n          env:\n            - name: DB_PASSWORD\n              valueFrom:\n                secretKeyRef: # value lives in a Secret, synced from a vault\n                  name: api-db\n                  key: password\n          resources:\n            requests:\n              cpu: 100m\n              memory: 128Mi\n            limits:\n              memory: 256Mi\n          readinessProbe:\n            httpGet:\n              path: /health\n              port: 8000\n          livenessProbe:\n            httpGet:\n              path: /health\n              port: 8000\n            initialDelaySeconds: 10\n          volumeMounts:\n            - name: tmp\n              mountPath: /tmp\n      volumes:\n        - name: tmp\n          emptyDir: {} # writable scratch space despite the read-only root filesystem\n",
        "note": {
          "fr": "Ce Pod respecte le niveau `restricted` : non root, pas d'élévation de privilèges, aucune capability, seccomp par défaut. Le système de fichiers en lecture seule empêche un attaquant de déposer ses outils ; `emptyDir` fournit le seul espace inscriptible.",
          "en": "This Pod meets the `restricted` level: non-root, no privilege escalation, no capabilities, default seccomp. The read-only filesystem stops an attacker from dropping tools; `emptyDir` provides the only writable space."
        }
